(1, 'David Harrington, FCA', 'Managing Partner', 'Harrington & Co Chartered Accountants', 'Central London', '', 5, 'Migrating from our legacy desktop software to SanSuite was the best operational decision we made this year. Having Accounts Production, CT600, and Practice CRM on a single unified database eliminated double entry completely. We save at least 15 hours per client during busy season.', 1, 1, 1, '2026-09-27 09:36:59'),
(2, 'Sarah Jenkins, FCCA', 'Founder & Principal', 'Apex Cloud Accounting Ltd', 'Manchester', '', 5, 'The unlimited user licensing model is a breath of fresh air. Other providers penalize you for growing your team with per-seat licensing fees. With SanSuite, all our staff and interns have full access with granular role controls.', 1, 2, 1, '2026-09-27 09:36:59'),
(3, 'Marcus Thorne', 'Senior Tax Director', 'Thorne & Partners Tax Advisory', 'Birmingham', '', 5, 'Making Tax Digital for Income Tax readiness was our top priority. SanSuite\'s MTD IT module with cumulative progression and bridging templates allowed us to onboard our sole trader clients seamlessly ahead of the statutory deadlines.', 1, 3, 1, '2026-09-27 09:36:59');

